# Keep the repository deterministic. Without this, git hands Windows users
# CRLF copies of the scripts, and a project whose whole subject is bytes
# surviving a round trip should not ship files whose bytes depend on the OS
# that cloned them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.csv  text eol=lf
